@startuml
left to right direction
actor Student
actor Administrator
rectangle "Smart Campus study room booking system" {
  usecase "View availability" as ViewAvailability
  usecase "Book room" as BookRoom
  usecase "Cancel booking" as CancelBooking
  usecase "Block / unblock room" as BlockRoom
  usecase "Review usage" as ReviewUsage
  usecase "Send confirmation" as SendConfirmation
}
Student -- ViewAvailability
Student -- BookRoom
Student -- CancelBooking
Administrator -- BlockRoom
Administrator -- ReviewUsage
' why: R4 and US-06 make confirmation a conditional outcome only after a booking succeeds.
SendConfirmation ..> BookRoom : <<extend>> [booking succeeds]
' why: US-06 also requires confirmation only after a cancellation succeeds.
SendConfirmation ..> CancelBooking : <<extend>> [cancellation succeeds]
@enduml
